---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AHGlasses | Projects | Wretzelectronics">
  <article class="project-detail">
    <header class="detail-header">
      <h1 class="project-title">AHGlasses</h1>
      <p class="project-tagline">Wearable real-time OCR and speech-to-text subtitle system.</p>
      <div class="tag-row">
        <span class="tag-badge">Pi Zero W</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Vosk Speech Engine</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Tesseract OCR</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">HTML Overlay</span>
      </div>

      <div class="action-row">
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/wretzel01/AHGlasses" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="cyber-button"
        >
          <svg class="github-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18">
            <path fill="currentColor" d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>View Source on GitHub</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
      <img src="/images/projects/ahglasses.png" alt="AHGlasses wearable rig" class="detail-hero-img" />
    </div>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        AHGlasses is a wearable system that provides real‑time OCR and speech‑to‑text subtitles. 
        The current prototype uses a Pi Zero W and camera module mounted on a pair of glasses, with a laptop handling OCR, speech recognition, and subtitle rendering. 
        The project explores lightweight wearable capture and real‑time processing. 
        Future updates may include improved OCR accuracy, better voice handling, and a more refined hardware design.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Architecture</h2>
      <p>
        AHGlasses uses a split design. 
        The Pi Zero W captures camera input and streams it to a laptop, which performs OCR, speech recognition, and subtitle generation. 
        This setup keeps the wearable light while offloading the heavier processing to the laptop.
      </p>

      <div class="diagram-block">
        <h3>System Architecture Diagram</h3>
        <p class="diagram-caption">High‑level view of camera, microphone, server, and subtitle renderer.</p>
        <img src="/images/projects/ahglasses-architecture.png" alt="AHGlasses architecture diagram" class="diagram-img" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Processing Pipeline</h2>
      <p>
        The pipeline includes camera capture, microphone input, OCR preprocessing, Vosk speech recognition, and HTML overlay rendering. 
        The system produces live subtitles in a browser window.
      </p>

      <div class="diagram-block">
        <h3>Data Flow / Pipeline Diagram</h3>
        <p class="diagram-caption">Data flow from camera and microphone to the live subtitle overlay.</p>
        <img src="/images/projects/ahglasses-pipeline.png" alt="AHGlasses data flow pipeline" class="diagram-img" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>User Interface</h2>
      <p>
        The browser‑based UI displays OCR and speech recognition results as live subtitles. 
        It is simple, responsive, and works in varied lighting and audio environments.
      </p>

      <div class="diagram-block">
        <h3>Subtitle Display</h3>
        <p class="diagram-caption">HTML overlay showing real‑time OCR and speech‑to‑text output.</p>
        <img src="/images/projects/ahglasses-ui.png" alt="AHGlasses subtitle UI" class="diagram-img" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Development Notes</h2>
      <p>
        Development focused on stabilizing the capture pipeline, improving OCR preprocessing, and handling noisy audio. 
        The current prototype works reliably for testing. 
        Future plans include refining the OCR and voice models and exploring a more compact hardware setup.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-detail {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .detail-header {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tag-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Header Action Bar & GitHub Button */
  .action-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  a.cyber-button,
  a.cyber-button:link,
  a.cyber-button:visited {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
  }

  a.cyber-button:hover {
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--border-glow, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6));
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    color: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff) !important;
  }

  .github-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    fill: currentColor;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .hero-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    background: #000;
  }

  .detail-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 480px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    color: var(--text-main, #e2e8f0);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .diagram-block {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diagram-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .diagram-caption {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;
  }

  .diagram-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    background: #000;
    display: block;
  }
</style>